/* Wireless: AWDL warning */
"AirDrop, Handoff and Universal Control can make wireless streaming stutter." = "AirDrop、Handoff 和 Universal Control 可能会导致无线串流卡顿。";
"They briefly take this Mac's Wi-Fi off its channel about twice a second (~80 ms each). Turn them off while streaming, connect the Mac by Ethernet, or use USB. To turn them off until the next restart or AirDrop: sudo ifconfig awdl0 down" = "这些功能每秒约有两次会让这台 Mac 的 Wi-Fi 短暂离开当前信道（每次约 80 ms）。串流时请将它们关闭，或使用以太网连接 Mac，或改用 USB。若要在下次重新启动或使用 AirDrop 之前将它们关闭：sudo ifconfig awdl0 down";

